# data/odds/ is tracked: the opening + closing snapshots are what CLV
# is computed from, so they need to reach the worker image and be
# backed up offsite. They're small CSVs.
# Fitted model coefficients are tiny (~2KB total) and the Railway
# worker needs them in the image — tracked deliberately.
